    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d85">

                <pb facs="0184" n="88" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg88"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890g.6363 T 84/21</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harvey</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-07"><hi rendition="#italic">December 7,
                        1921</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received December 22.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 749</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In my telegram No. 930 of November 18, 5
                        p.m.,<anchor n="28" xml:id="d85-f1"/> I had the honor to advise you that the
                    Note transmitted by your Confidential Instruction No. 233 of November 4, with
                    reference to the claim of the Turkish Petroleum Company in Mesopotamia, had been
                    presented to the Foreign Office. The content of the last paragraph of the
                    Instruction was stated orally as directed.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to transmit herewith the text of the Note as delivered. Copies
                    were mailed to the Missions at Berlin, Paris, Rome and Berne, and to the High
                    Commission at Constantinople.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Ambassador:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Post
                            Wheeler</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Counselor of
                        Embassy</hi></closer>



                <xi:include href="d85-a1.xml" xpointer="d85-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
